# Webhook POSTed once at boot, after WireGuard connects (or fails to),
# with a plain-text message (Content-Type: text/plain) listing the LAN,
# public and WireGuard addresses, or the WireGuard error. Works with
# e.g. ntfy or a matrix-hookshot generic webhook. Leave it commented out
# to disable.
#
# WEBHOOK_URL=https://ntfy.sh/a-long-random-topic
